The second match of the semi-finals.

2
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:08,940
Nankatsu SC is playing against Musashi FC, led by Misugi Jun.

3
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:12,360
At first, both teams fought on equal terms.

4
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:15,280
However, with his technical superiority, Misugi...

5
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:21,290
...also using his secret plan, the offside trap, put Tsubasa behind.

6
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:23,580
There's an offside call!

7
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,080
Offside again!

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:33,550
With this, Nankatsu's attacks were cut off and they were put in a difficult situation.

9
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:37,180
He's playing much more technically than me.

10
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:42,140
He's also better than me at directing his team as captain.

11
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:47,100
Moreover, there's the obstacle of his heart condition.

12
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,440
I really can't win.

13
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:53,900
I can't match Misugi-kun.

14
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,570
What happened, Tsubasa-kun?!

15
00:00:55,570 --> 00:00:58,490
Have you lost your fighting spirit?!

16
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:00,070
I can't match him.

17
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:03,080
I beg you, Tsubasa-kun! Come at me!

18
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:05,200
Stop my dribble!

19
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,660
I can't match him.

20
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:12,130
It's over.

21
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:18,550
Sanada-kun scores! 3-1!

22
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:21,140
They're up by 2 goals!

23
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:24,940
Everyone, this match is ours now.

24
00:01:24,940 --> 00:01:28,020
Don't hold back! Crush Nankatsu!

25
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:29,810
Okay!

