50
00:03:05,330 --> 00:03:10,080
Episode 21:

51
00:03:05,330 --> 00:03:10,080
The Glass Star Player

52
00:03:05,330 --> 00:03:10,080
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

53
00:03:10,290 --> 00:03:11,580
Get up, Tsubasa!

54
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:15,000
You have to get up, Tsubasa!

55
00:03:16,670 --> 00:03:17,920
Wakabayashi-san!

56
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:19,920
Wakabayashi.

57
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:23,240
Do you intend to let it end like this?

58
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:26,350
Will you waste the effort everyone put in to come here?

59
00:03:26,350 --> 00:03:31,480
Is Nankatsu's football... Your football only this much?!

60
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,760
Answer me, Tsubasa!

61
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:36,150
W-Wakabayashi-kun.

62
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:39,650
I came all this way to play in tomorrow's final.

63
00:03:39,650 --> 00:03:43,650
Answer me, Tsubasa! Are you throwing in the towel already?!

64
00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:47,320
Wakabayashi is right!

65
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,620
Are you going to let it end like this?!

66
00:03:49,620 --> 00:03:53,460
Aren't you coming to Brazil with me, Tsubasa?!

67
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:55,120
Roberto...

68
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,580
Exactly!

69
00:03:56,580 --> 00:03:59,500
Losing doesn't suit you!

70
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:01,300
Do your best, Tsubasa-kun!

71
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,920
I'm supporting you.

72
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,810
So win!

73
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:10,930
Tsubasa, you're not someone who would let it end like this.

74
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:14,640
You're the first person I accepted as a rival.

75
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:17,690
There can't be anyone stronger than this rival of mine.

76
00:04:17,690 --> 00:04:21,020
Even if you accept it, I don't!

77
00:04:21,610 --> 00:04:23,070
Get up, Tsubasa!

78
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:27,950
This time, together we'll defeat Hyuga Kojiro from Meiwa!

79
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:31,330
I have payback to give him.

80
00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:34,960
Tsubasa, you owe him for the qualifiers too.

81
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:39,840
Despite that, won't you fight, Tsubasa?!

82
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,840
That's right, Tsubasa-kun.

83
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:46,990
Misugi-kun surely doesn't think this suits you either.

84
00:04:46,990 --> 00:04:47,680
What?

85
00:04:48,370 --> 00:04:50,300
You can't let it end like this.

86
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:54,440
If it ends like this, to your teammates, to everyone who supports you...

87
00:04:54,440 --> 00:05:00,020
...to the opponents you've fought so far, and even to this football, you'd be betraying them.

88
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,160
Tsubasa.

89
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,420
Tsubasa!

90
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,040
Tsubasa-kun!

91
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:26,550
I'm sorry, everyone.

92
00:05:26,550 --> 00:05:29,300
Even though I'm the captain, I showed such weakness.

93
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:30,830
You're right.

94
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:33,480
We can't let it end like this.

95
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:36,930
I was about to waste the sweat all of us put into football.

96
00:05:36,930 --> 00:05:38,440
I'll do it.

97
00:05:40,070 --> 00:05:43,400
I'll score 2 goals and turn the match around!

98
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,480
That's it!

99
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:47,200
Now that Tsubasa is back, this is a piece of cake!

100
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,570
Yes! The real match starts now!

101
00:05:49,570 --> 00:05:51,410
Let's show what Nankatsu is worth!

102
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,330
Watch closely, Wakabayashi-kun.

103
00:05:53,330 --> 00:05:55,370
I'll do it.

104
00:05:55,370 --> 00:05:56,870
Tsubasa...

105
00:05:59,450 --> 00:06:02,670
You haven't thrown in the towel yet, Tsubasa-kun.

106
00:06:02,670 --> 00:06:06,220
Nankatsu SC seems to have come to their senses.

107
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:09,680
They look like they're going to press the attack, but they're 2 goals down!

108
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:13,680
Can they score 2 goals in the remaining 10 minutes?

109
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,360
Do your best, Tsubasa-kun!

110
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,930
We're counting on you, everyone!

111
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:20,940
The match continues with Nankatsu's kick-off.

112
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:22,330
I'm coming, Musashi!

113
00:06:22,330 --> 00:06:24,690
Alright! Let's follow Tsubasa too!

114
00:06:24,690 --> 00:06:25,610
I won't allow it!

115
00:06:26,380 --> 00:06:29,650
Tsubasa-kun dribbles wonderfully once again.

116
00:06:29,650 --> 00:06:30,740
Tsubasa!

117
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:37,330
That's it, Tsubasa-kun!

118
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:39,020
That's it, Tsubasa.

119
00:06:39,020 --> 00:06:44,000
Until now, you were losing to Misugi not because of technique, but because of will.

120
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,050
Don't forget this determination...

121
00:06:46,050 --> 00:06:51,630
...and once again advance as my prodigy football, Tsubasa!

122
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:55,680
This time Tsubasa-kun jumps and dodges!

123
00:06:55,680 --> 00:07:01,640
Despite the rain, he neither slows down nor loses his balance.

124
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:04,690
This is what the real Tsubasa-kun is like!

125
00:07:07,010 --> 00:07:07,820
Misaki-kun!

126
00:07:10,530 --> 00:07:11,740
What?!

127
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:13,990
I'm returning it, Tsubasa-kun!

128
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:17,370
Amazing passing!

129
00:07:17,370 --> 00:07:19,370
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun's combined play!

130
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:22,060
Nankatsu's Golden Duo is back!

131
00:07:22,060 --> 00:07:24,000
You're amazing, Tsubasa, Misaki!

132
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:27,520
But goalkeeper Tazawa-kun and Misugi-kun are standing in front of them.

133
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:29,760
Right now, Misugi-kun's technique might be better.

134
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:33,260
...but I will definitely win this battle with my determination!

135
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:34,880
Come, Tsubasa-kun!

136
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:37,010
As Misugi Jun, I won't let you pass!

137
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,510
- Time to fight!
- Time to fight!

138
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,560
Wow! He stopped it!

139
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,190
Tsubasa!

140
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:51,320
I won!

141
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,570
Not yet!

142
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,280
What?!

143
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,840
An amazing move!

144
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:58,830
As he falls, Tsubasa-kun flicks the ball up with his heel!

145
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:01,080
But Kido-kun is running to clear the ball!

146
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,390
Tsubasa, jump!

147
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:03,460
Use your stomach!

148
00:08:03,460 --> 00:08:05,750
Wakabayashi-kun.

149
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:13,010
Despite being in a difficult position, Tsubasa-kun jumps!

150
00:08:14,730 --> 00:08:16,640
The goalkeeper can't reach it!

151
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:17,640
He did it!

152
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:22,020
The ball hits the post and bounces away.

153
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:26,020
Nankatsu's revived star player can't score!

154
00:08:26,020 --> 00:08:28,940
Despite Tsubasa's efforts, is it not enough?

155
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:30,690
It's not over yet!

156
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:34,120
Let's show them Nankatsu's all-out attack!

157
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:34,890
Yes!

158
00:08:34,890 --> 00:08:35,700
Everyone!

159
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:38,450
Nankatsu's fighting spirit hasn't given up yet!

160
00:08:40,890 --> 00:08:42,500
Urabe-kun steals the ball!

161
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:44,710
Alright! Let's go, Tsubasa!

162
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:46,400
They're going to send a long pass!

163
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:47,040
Go!

164
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,480
Offside trap!

165
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,400
Okay!

166
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,870
That's it!

167
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:56,180
I'll follow the offside line!

168
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:00,760
Don't pass now!

169
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,110
What?!

170
00:09:02,110 --> 00:09:05,940
Misaki-kun blocked Urabe-kun's pass!

171
00:09:12,270 --> 00:09:14,100
Now!

172
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:16,100
Misaki-kun passes to Tsubasa-kun!

173
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:16,740
Oh no!

174
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:18,570
This time, score, Tsubasa!

175
00:09:18,570 --> 00:09:20,830
There are still players and the goalkeeper he needs to pass!

176
00:09:20,830 --> 00:09:23,080
This isn't offside!

177
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:29,960
Goal!

178
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:34,000
Tsubasa-kun escapes the offside trap and scores an amazing jumping volley!

179
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,630
I did it!

180
00:09:35,630 --> 00:09:37,630
Tsubasa, nice shot!

181
00:09:37,630 --> 00:09:39,510
You did it, Tsubasa-kun!

182
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:41,510
Tsubasa-kun did it.

183
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:44,400
A wonderful shot that signals the star player's return!

184
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:47,140
Together with Misaki-kun, Nankatsu's Golden Duo is back as well.

185
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,720
Tsubasa-kun!

186
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,720
3-2.

187
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:53,150
In the 10th minute of the second half, Nankatsu is one goal away from catching the leader!

188
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:54,530
Tsubasa...

189
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:56,890
You did it, Tsubasa.

190
00:09:56,890 --> 00:10:00,780
Right now, Misugi might be technically better.

191
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:05,790
But the only reason for that is that Misugi has developed his skills.

192
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:10,000
In contrast, you are progressing towards becoming a better player.

193
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,420
Your potential, your determination...

194
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:17,580
...and most importantly, you're blessed with friends you'll grow together with.

195
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:21,820
It's been a long time since I've seen you this happy, Roberto.

196
00:10:23,410 --> 00:10:26,340
Now our offside trap has become useless too.

197
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:28,810
You pulled yourself together well, Tsubasa-kun.

198
00:10:28,810 --> 00:10:31,560
We have an unfinished matter!

199
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:35,760
My love, it's been a long time since the doctor's time limit passed.

200
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:38,610
Let's take Jun back to the bench.

201
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:41,040
Kojima, warm up.

202
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:42,610
You might need to go in.

203
00:10:42,610 --> 00:10:44,950
What? O-Okay.

204
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:49,710
Listen. Right now, Nankatsu is coming, carried by a wave.

205
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:53,610
Let's weather this wave by putting our spirit into it!

206
00:10:53,610 --> 00:10:54,340
Yes!

207
00:10:55,590 --> 00:10:58,590
The match continues with Musashi's kick-off.

208
00:10:58,590 --> 00:11:01,340
I'm coming, Tsubasa and Nankatsu!

209
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:04,350
Once again, I'll overcome Nankatsu with my talent!

210
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:15,480
Doctor, how is Kojiro's condition?

211
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:17,200
With that heat exposure during the day...

212
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:21,440
...combined with accumulated fatigue and mental stress...

213
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,490
...it seems his condition has worsened.

214
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:26,160
It looks like overexertion.

215
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:30,250
What he needs right now is bed rest and sleep.

216
00:11:30,250 --> 00:11:32,500
Kojiro...

217
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:35,790
Coach Kira, how is Hyuga-san?

218
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:37,880
Will our captain be able to play in tomorrow's match?

219
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,420
Don't worry!

220
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:43,430
There's no way Kojiro will miss this fight!

221
00:11:43,430 --> 00:11:45,050
Really?!

222
00:11:46,260 --> 00:11:52,980
Right now, the tiger just needs to rest. To gather strength for tomorrow's final.

223
00:11:56,960 --> 00:12:01,950
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

224
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:07,700
In the semi-final of the National Youth Football Tournament, Musashi FC and Nankatsu SC.

225
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:09,950
Even though there's very little time left in the match...

226
00:12:09,950 --> 00:12:12,240
...it's going very fiercely.

227
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:16,080
Both teams are fighting under the pouring rain!

228
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:19,710
Hold on, Nankatsu!

229
00:12:19,710 --> 00:12:21,460
It's time to do your best!

230
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:25,040
Has the backbone of the team...

231
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:27,390
...Misugi-kun, run out of energy?

232
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:29,760
His movements are starting to slow down.

233
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,020
Jun!

234
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:31,930
Captain!

235
00:12:34,300 --> 00:12:37,560
Don't think you're the only one who can dominate, Misugi!

236
00:12:39,010 --> 00:12:40,830
Nankatsu is fighting non-stop!

237
00:12:40,830 --> 00:12:43,900
But Misugi-kun refuses to give up the ball!

238
00:12:44,740 --> 00:12:46,860
How can he move like this in the rain?!

239
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:48,740
He should be tired!

240
00:12:49,780 --> 00:12:53,830
This time Tsubasa-kun comes to take the ball!

241
00:12:53,830 --> 00:12:57,290
Misugi-kun, I'm coming with everything I have!

242
00:12:58,660 --> 00:13:00,040
He got the ball!

243
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:04,300
This time Tsubasa-kun took the ball very nicely from Misugi-kun!

244
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:05,920
That's it, Tsubasa!

245
00:13:05,920 --> 00:13:07,800
Football isn't just technique!

246
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:12,680
Sometimes, just like Hyuga does, it needs power and speed!

247
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:14,270
Damn it! Stop him!

248
00:13:14,270 --> 00:13:17,140
Musashi's defense is coming back!

249
00:13:17,140 --> 00:13:21,650
The field is muddy. At this rate, they'll catch up! All or nothing!

250
00:13:21,650 --> 00:13:23,440
Alright! Got it!

251
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:26,570
What?!

252
00:13:26,570 --> 00:13:29,960
Tsubasa-kun slides a long distance using the water on the ground!

253
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:32,580
Faster than Musashi's defense running!

254
00:13:32,580 --> 00:13:33,580
What?!

255
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:36,660
And while sliding, he gets into shooting position!

256
00:13:39,620 --> 00:13:40,760
Goal!

257
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,670
Equalizer!

258
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:46,420
As a result of cleverly using the wet field, Tsubasa-kun slides and scores!

259
00:13:46,420 --> 00:13:48,420
We finally tied it up!

260
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:50,120
You did it, Tsubasa-kun!

261
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,430
You made friends with the rainy field too.

262
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:57,980
W-What's happening?

263
00:13:57,980 --> 00:14:03,570
Musashi FC's Captain Misugi-kun is writhing on the ground, clutching his chest!

264
00:14:03,570 --> 00:14:04,690
Misugi-kun!

265
00:14:04,690 --> 00:14:05,610
Captain!

266
00:14:05,610 --> 00:14:06,820
Captain!

267
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:08,570
Jun!

268
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:09,570
My love!

269
00:14:11,490 --> 00:14:13,950
Substitution! Kojima!

270
00:14:13,950 --> 00:14:14,730
Okay.

271
00:14:14,730 --> 00:14:19,580
Wait. Please wait. Coach...

272
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:22,710
You promised.

273
00:14:22,710 --> 00:14:27,090
That I would play the whole match.

274
00:14:27,090 --> 00:14:28,840
Misugi...

275
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:32,910
Everyone, I'm sorry for hiding it until now.

276
00:14:32,910 --> 00:14:36,060
As you can see, I have a heart condition.

277
00:14:37,140 --> 00:14:40,270
That's why the amount I could play in matches was limited.

278
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:43,100
But this match is different.

279
00:14:43,100 --> 00:14:47,280
Nankatsu is not an opponent we can beat if I play just a few minutes.

280
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,810
That's why I made this decision!

281
00:14:49,810 --> 00:14:52,660
Even if this is my last match, I don't care!

282
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:55,340
In return, I will play the entire match...

283
00:14:55,340 --> 00:14:59,130
...and in my last match, I will fight giving it everything I have!

284
00:14:59,130 --> 00:15:00,410
Captain...

285
00:15:00,410 --> 00:15:03,330
That's why I refuse to come off!

286
00:15:03,330 --> 00:15:07,920
Tsubasa-kun, our battle isn't over yet!

287
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:09,120
Misugi-kun...

288
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:11,600
Keep going, Jun!

289
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:16,660
No one will stop you from playing the football you love today.

290
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:18,850
Fight with all your might until the very end!

291
00:15:18,850 --> 00:15:20,480
Dad...

292
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:23,600
Kojima, there won't be a substitution.

293
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:26,980
Misugi, the match is entrusted to you!

294
00:15:26,980 --> 00:15:28,350
Coach...

295
00:15:28,350 --> 00:15:30,160
Let's do this, Captain!

296
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:32,420
We'll follow you until the end!

297
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:33,610
Guys...

298
00:15:33,610 --> 00:15:35,700
So Misugi had a heart condition!

299
00:15:35,700 --> 00:15:37,380
He did?!

300
00:15:37,380 --> 00:15:40,060
Everyone, play as usual.

301
00:15:40,060 --> 00:15:40,750
What?

302
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:45,840
We will respond by putting everything on the line with our fighting spirit!

303
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:51,340
Tsubasa-kun, I hear you knew about Misugi-kun's heart condition.

304
00:15:51,860 --> 00:15:56,100
Only 7 minutes remain until the end of the National Youth Football Tournament semi-final match.

305
00:15:56,100 --> 00:15:59,140
Misugi-kun still seems to have a problem with his body.

306
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:02,480
He's clutching his chest and has fallen back to midfield.

307
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:04,070
Captain...

308
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:08,400
The match continues with Musashi's kick-off.

309
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:11,070
We will share our Captain's burden too!

310
00:16:11,070 --> 00:16:11,780
Yes!

311
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:13,360
Misugi-kun...

312
00:16:15,890 --> 00:16:17,720
Tsubasa-kun steals the ball!

313
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:19,580
He's approaching Musashi's side.

314
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:21,320
Alright, time to reverse the score!

315
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:21,950
Yes!

316
00:16:21,950 --> 00:16:25,290
But Misugi-kun is standing in front of Tsubasa-kun!

317
00:16:27,900 --> 00:16:30,820
Misugi-kun, if it weren't for your illness...

318
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:33,550
...you could have continued playing the football you love.

319
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:37,250
But I won't lose.

320
00:16:37,250 --> 00:16:38,850
I love football very much too.

321
00:16:38,850 --> 00:16:43,310
I can't lose to anyone in the football I love!

322
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:46,900
Not working! Misugi-kun still can't move!

323
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:53,070
No way! Misugi-san!

324
00:16:53,070 --> 00:16:56,280
The Young Ace of the Field is covered in mud.

325
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,620
Captain...

326
00:16:57,620 --> 00:16:59,520
Musashi is defending desperately!

327
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,870
Take it, Kisugi-kun!

328
00:17:01,280 --> 00:17:02,240
Got it!

329
00:17:03,540 --> 00:17:05,250
Kanda-kun blocks him nicely!

330
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:06,190
I'll score!

331
00:17:06,190 --> 00:17:07,920
Taki-kun goes up for an aerial ball!

332
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:09,330
I won't allow it!

333
00:17:09,330 --> 00:17:11,420
No, Sanada-kun blocks it.

334
00:17:11,420 --> 00:17:13,420
Izawa-kun shoots.

335
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:15,880
The goalkeeper clears it!

336
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:18,300
The ball goes to Honma-kun.

337
00:17:18,300 --> 00:17:19,880
Musashi escapes a difficult situation.

338
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:22,720
Come, Honma! Pass!

339
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,890
Pass to me, Honma!

340
00:17:24,890 --> 00:17:27,770
Captain, I'm counting on you!

341
00:17:27,770 --> 00:17:29,730
Pass from Honma-kun to Misugi-kun.

342
00:17:29,730 --> 00:17:32,020
Musashi is about to counter-attack.

343
00:17:32,020 --> 00:17:32,610
Alright.

344
00:17:33,460 --> 00:17:37,200
Misugi-kun starts dribbling while on the verge of exhaustion!

345
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,450
Everyone fall back!

346
00:17:38,450 --> 00:17:39,960
It hurts.

347
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:43,520
My chest... I feel like my heart is going to explode.

348
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:48,250
Every step I take on the field, a knife stabs into my heart.

349
00:17:48,250 --> 00:17:51,720
But my heart is still beating.

350
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:53,240
I can dribble.

351
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:56,760
I can still jump and shoot.

352
00:17:56,760 --> 00:18:03,070
Dad, mom, manager, coach, my teammates...

353
00:18:03,070 --> 00:18:05,770
And those who have supported me so far...

354
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:08,670
I thank you all.

355
00:18:08,670 --> 00:18:11,880
As Misugi Jun... As the Captain of Musashi FC...

356
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:16,030
...even if I die for everyone, I will score this goal!

357
00:18:16,030 --> 00:18:18,280
Misugi-kun moves very fast!

358
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:20,230
What speed!

359
00:18:20,230 --> 00:18:23,410
Even though he's the one dribbling, how can he go so fast?!

360
00:18:23,410 --> 00:18:25,200
At this rate, we won't catch him!

361
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,790
I have no other choice!

362
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:30,120
Misaki-kun comes sliding in with a long-range tackle!

363
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:32,130
He uses the water on the field to accelerate!

364
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:33,130
Amazing, Misaki!

365
00:18:33,130 --> 00:18:34,380
Captain, watch out!

366
00:18:34,380 --> 00:18:37,260
Jump! Rise and dodge it!

367
00:18:39,130 --> 00:18:40,970
He rises and dodges it!

368
00:18:40,970 --> 00:18:45,060
How can he jump that high when the field is this slippery?

369
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:47,850
But center-back Takasugi-kun is after him!

370
00:18:47,850 --> 00:18:49,600
I'll stop you, Misugi!

371
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:52,100
Watch out! Misugi's heart is on his left side!

372
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,150
Jun!

373
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:57,150
He's losing his balance!

374
00:18:57,150 --> 00:18:58,400
Misugi!

375
00:18:59,980 --> 00:19:04,200
But as he falls, Misugi-kun manages to keep the ball using his leg!

376
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:07,150
Takasugi-kun is knocked down!

377
00:19:07,150 --> 00:19:09,830
A kid with a determination we've never seen before!

378
00:19:09,830 --> 00:19:12,210
But will Misugi-kun be able to shoot?

379
00:19:12,210 --> 00:19:15,370
Nankatsu's Captain Tsubasa-kun is also turning back.

380
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:17,670
Captain!

381
00:19:17,670 --> 00:19:19,760
You fought wonderfully, Misugi-kun.

382
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:21,930
But right now, I won't hold back.

383
00:19:22,410 --> 00:19:26,020
Tsubasa-kun, I can't give you this ball.

384
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:28,180
This ball is my ball.

385
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:30,140
The ball I'm going to shoot!

386
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:32,990
Tsubasa-kun clears the ball!

387
00:19:32,990 --> 00:19:35,150
But Misugi-kun desperately blocks!

388
00:19:36,610 --> 00:19:40,990
What?! The ball rises above both of them!

389
00:19:44,630 --> 00:19:45,950
My eyes...

390
00:19:45,950 --> 00:19:47,950
I got it away! I cleared it!

391
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:53,290
The ball... My ball...

392
00:19:53,290 --> 00:19:56,090
Ball! Where's the ball?

393
00:19:56,090 --> 00:19:59,380
Where's the ball?!

394
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:03,720
Captain! The ball is right in front of you, slightly to your right!

395
00:20:04,530 --> 00:20:06,970
I can see it. I can see it!

396
00:20:06,970 --> 00:20:08,560
My ball...

397
00:20:10,930 --> 00:20:12,210
...is right here!

398
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:14,440
Misugi-kun shoots a second earlier!

399
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:17,380
Morisaki-kun can't reach it!

400
00:20:17,380 --> 00:20:21,190
Goal! Misugi-kun scores with determination!

401
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:26,030
4-3!

402
00:20:26,030 --> 00:20:29,540
Musashi scores with less than 2 minutes left and takes the lead!

403
00:20:30,400 --> 00:20:32,410
It went in...

404
00:20:32,410 --> 00:20:34,040
You did it, Misugi-san!

405
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:36,420
What persistence he scored with.

406
00:20:36,420 --> 00:20:38,540
That's to be expected from our Captain!

407
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:53,350
Misugi-kun...

408
00:21:03,750 --> 00:21:05,170
It's beating.

409
00:21:08,830 --> 00:21:12,750
My heart is still beating.

410
00:21:13,950 --> 00:21:15,420
I'm fine!

411
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:18,210
My heart hasn't given up yet!

412
00:21:18,210 --> 00:21:19,210
Misugi-kun!

413
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:20,210
Captain!

414
00:21:20,210 --> 00:21:21,210
Jun!

415
00:21:21,210 --> 00:21:23,840
Misugi-san, are you okay?

416
00:21:23,840 --> 00:21:26,970
Tsubasa-kun, we're one goal ahead of you.

417
00:21:28,220 --> 00:21:33,350
We will protect this goal, and Musashi will be the ones advancing to the final.

418
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:37,770
Misugi-kun...

419
00:21:39,620 --> 00:21:41,480
Less than 2 minutes left in the match.

420
00:21:41,480 --> 00:21:47,540
As a result of Misugi-kun playing with great effort, the score is 4-3! Musashi leads by one goal!

421
00:21:47,540 --> 00:21:49,260
What's wrong, everyone?!

422
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:51,370
The match isn't over yet!

423
00:21:51,370 --> 00:21:52,820
Just one goal!

424
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:54,330
You can still turn it around!

425
00:21:54,330 --> 00:21:56,740
Exactly! Win, Nankatsu!

426
00:21:54,330 --> 00:21:56,740
Do your best!

427
00:21:56,740 --> 00:21:59,440
You never know what will happen until the final whistle blows!

428
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:01,250
Alright, let's do our best, everyone.

429
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:03,880
Yes. The match isn't over yet.

430
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:06,260
Let's give it everything until the very last moment!

431
00:22:06,750 --> 00:22:08,630
One goal is a big difference.

432
00:22:09,130 --> 00:22:12,140
And you're feeling something much bigger, Misugi-kun.

433
00:22:12,140 --> 00:22:16,060
But in football, 10 seconds is enough to score a goal.

434
00:22:16,060 --> 00:22:18,090
I will definitely catch up to you!

